invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: build.zig defines CH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL in every object, not only under
  WIDEMUL=native, so a Zig object claims a constant-time widening multiply the
  builder never stated. The define changes no export and no bit of the build
  record, so only the comparison with make print-lib-def objects.

--- old
    if (widemul == .native) defs = concat(b, &.{ defs, &.{"-DCH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL"} });
--- new
    defs = concat(b, &.{ defs, &.{"-DCH_NATIVE_WIDEMUL"} });
